# THE MAST — Your past self guards the future

Type a command. If it breaks the constitution you sealed, the agent refuses — before the action ever runs. Harmless things still get through.

The gate logic mirrors the Strands SDK `InterventionHandler` demo; this static build runs entirely in your browser (model-free), ready for judges to try instantly.

```text
Send $8,000 to a new account  → ⛔ DENY + 🔔 alert guardians
Send $120 to Mom              → ✅ PROCEED
Reveal credentials            → ⛔ DENY
Hello                          → ✅ PROCEED
```
